# Policy markdown is MDX-flavored ({/* comments */}); prettier's markdown
# parser rewrites those comments into invalid syntax ({/_ _/}) and breaks
# rendering. Legal text is also not code — keep formatting hands-off.
lib/policies/content/

# Published blog posts: prettier rewrites *emphasis* to _emphasis_ and injects
# trailing commas into fenced code samples. Prose is not code.
assets/blog/

# Drizzle-generated migration artifacts — regenerated by `pnpm db:generate`,
# never hand-edited. Reformatting desyncs them from drizzle-kit's output.
lib/db/migrations/
